<title>CHINA: China interbank market rates(CHIBOR) mostly down.</title>
<headline>China interbank market rates(CHIBOR) mostly down.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the China</p>
<p>Interbank Offered Rate (CHIBOR) for Friday issued by the</p>
<p>official Xinhua news agency on behalf of the People's Bank of</p>
<p>China, the central bank.</p>
<p>The figures represent weighted averages and not closing</p>
<p>prices and are annual percentage rates.</p>
<p>		1DAY   7DAY  20DAY  30DAY  60DAY  90DAY  120DAY</p>
<p> FRIDAY    10.080 10.832  N/A   10.881 10.919 11.700 10.948</p>
<p>THURSDAY  10.112 10.805 11.024 11.405 11.323 11.248 11.389</p>
<p>Turnover fell to 1.272 billion yuan from 1.896 billion yuan with the 60-day contract the most actively traded.</p>
</text>
